## Title: Antiquity Tracker
## Description: Browse all antiquities in a single scrollable list. Sort by quality, time left, zone, or name. Filter by lead status, recovered, mythic/set, or repeatable. Mythic set pieces display their mythic item name. Lead expiry timers shown with red warnings under 24h. Preview panel with full details and lead drop location hints. Full gamepad/console support.
